  "body": "- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Blink (Chromium): `We will add support for this if it gets merged to the HTML spec`\n   * Gecko (Firefox): The bug report did get reopened after I referenced to this pull request, so I assume they will implement it as soon as it is spec.\n   * WebKit (Safari): WebKit is unable to implement `lbry`, because they don't support `registerProtocolHandler` at all. However, they didn't oppose.\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * N/A\n- [x] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Blink (Chromium): https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1514394\n   * Gecko (Firefox): https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1871955\n   * WebKit (Safari): https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=266903 and https://feedbackassistant.apple.com/feedback/13571353\n- [x] [MDN issue](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) is filed: https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/472\n\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n\n### :boom: Error: Wattsi server error :boom: ###\n\n[PR Preview](https://github.com/tobie/pr-preview#pr-preview) failed to build. _(Last tried on Feb 3, 2024, 3:29 PM UTC)_.\n\n<details>\n<summary>More</summary>\n\n\nPR Preview relies on a number of web services to run. There seems to be an issue with the following one:\n\n:rotating_light: [Wattsi Server](https://github.com/domenic/wattsi-server) - Wattsi Server is the web service used to build the WHATWG HTML spec.\n\n:link: [Related URL](https://build.whatwg.org/wattsi)\n\n```\nParsing MDN data...\nParsing...\nParse Error: (795,87) parse error while closing p element\n\n```\n\n_If you don't have enough information above to solve the error by yourself (or to understand to which web service the error is related to, if any), please [file an issue](https://github.com/tobie/pr-preview/issues/new?title=Error%20not%20surfaced%20properly&body=See%20whatwg/html%239017.)._\n</details>\n",
